<title>INDIA: India's 364 day t-bill yield steady at 12.65 pct.</title>
<headline>India's 364 day t-bill yield steady at 12.65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off on the 364-day treasury bill at 88.80 rupees at the auction held on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 12.65 percent.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 19 bids for 4.37 billion rupees of which it accepted eight for 3.21 billion. The weighted-average price worked out to 88.81 rupees, the RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
